# TruffleHog path exclusions, shared by the local pre-commit hook and CI.
#
# One POSIX regular expression per line, matched against each file's
# repo-relative path. A matching file is skipped by the secret scan. Blank lines
# and lines starting with '#' are ignored.
#
# Use this ONLY for paths that legitimately contain secret-shaped strings that
# are NOT real credentials (test fixtures, sample/example data, generated
# files). Keep patterns narrow so the scanner stays useful. For a single line,
# prefer an inline `trufflehog:ignore` comment instead.
#
# Examples (uncomment / adapt as needed):
# ^backend/tests/fixtures/
# ^backend/tests/data/.*\.sample$
# ^frontend/.*/__mocks__/
